  ('Cucumber, Slicing (Lagos)', 'A high-yielding, parthenocarpic slicing cucumber variety ideal for protected culture or tunnel farming, often yielding long, dark-green fruits. These cucumbers are designed for fresh consumption, typically characterized by smooth, non-bumpy skin, offering a refreshing crunch for salads, sandwiches, and culinary uses.', '24-30 inches', '60-65 days', 'Indeterminate', 'Cucumber', '$5', 10),
