  ('Eggplant (Ensoro Ewia)', 'Ensuro Ewia used to be one common vegetable that could be seen in a typical Ghanaian home many years back, especially among the Bono’s and the Ashanti’s. It’s very nutritious with less bitterness. It makes great stew, soup and stir fries, it’s tender fruits are chopped and eaten on salads.', '24-36 inches', '75-85 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Fengyuan Purple)', 'A slender, long Asian heirloom variety from Taiwan, known for its mild, sweet, and non-bitter flavor. These eggplants, often 12–16+ inches long with thin, dark purple skin, are excellent for stir-frying, steaming, and grilling due to their tender texture and creamy white flesh.', '24-36 inches', '70-80 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Lao Green Stripe)', 'A heirloom eggplant from Laos and is also known as "Green Tiger Stripe" eggplant. Fruits grow to 2 inches and are round. Prized for its sweet, tender flesh and is ideal for Southeast Asian dishes, including curries, soups, and Lao eggplant dips (Jeow Mak Keua)', '24-36 inches', '80-90 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Melanzana Rossa Di Rotonda) - Heirloom', 'it tastes like a combination of eggplant, tomatoes, and peppers. It is traditionally made into gourmet caponata or preserved and pickled.', '18-24 inches', '75-80 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Ping Tung)', 'A slender, long, purple eggplant variety known for its mild flavor and smooth skin. Try them tossed into curries and stir fries or slide onto skewers for a perfect bite-sized treat.', '24-36 inches', '65-75 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Rosa Bianca)', 'Highly prized Sicilian heirloom eggplant known for its stunning, creamy white and lavender-pink streaked skin and, most notably, its mild, sweet, and completely non-bitter flavor. It is a favorite among chefs for its soft, creamy texture, ideal for roasting, grilling, or slicing into eggplant parmesan.', '24-36 inches', '75-80 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
