  ('Eggplant (Traviata)', 'early-maturing hybrid Italian eggplant known for its glossy, dark purple, bell-shaped fruit, typically growing to 6-8 inches.', '24-36 inches', '70-80 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
  ('Eggplant (Turkish Delight)', 'Upright plants produce large yields of uniform, elongated fruit with eye-catching, deep purple skin and bright green calyxes.', '18-24 inches', '70-80 days', 'Determinate', 'Eggplant', '$5', 10),
